Because UndertaleModLib is GPL-3.0 (copyleft), LodestonePatcher is also licensed
under the **GNU GPL v3.0** (see managed/Launcher/LICENSE). UndertaleModLib is used
unmodified, built from the pinned submodule external/UndertaleModTool (tag
0.9.2.0). The full GPL-3.0 text ships with each release as COPYING.GPL-3.0.txt.

Scope of the GPL obligation
---------------------------
The GPL-3.0 terms apply to LodestonePatcher and the UndertaleModLib code it links.
The native installer (lodestone_installer) runs LodestonePatcher as a separate
process (arm's-length aggregation, not linking) and, together with the rest of
the CoreLoader/Lodestone loader, mods, and tooling, is not a derivative work of
LodestonePatcher and keeps its own license.
